      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report an autopsy case showing medial necrosis at the segment of sirolimus-eluting stent implantation. These findings indicate that cytotoxic effects of sirolimus can induce late-acquired incomplete stent apposition and/or aneurysmal changes after stenting in human coronary arteries."},
